&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;technical and strategic Engineering Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to lead our &lt;strong&gt;Engineering&lt;/strong&gt; efforts Internationally to power custom applications we build for our public sector clients.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
